<title>HONDURAS: SOCCER-HONDURAS AND JAMAICA DRAW IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HONDURAS AND JAMAICA DRAW IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SAN PEDRO SULA, Honduras 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honduras and</p>
<p>Jamaica drew 0-0 in their World Cup CONCACAF semifinal stage,</p>
<p>group 3 qualifying match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> Jamaica	4  2  1  1  6  3  7</p>
<p> Honduras     4  2  1  1  6  5  7</p>
<p> Mexico	 3  2  0  1  6  3  6</p>
<p> St Vincent   3  0  0  3  2  9  0</p>
<p>Next match: Oct 30 - Mexico v St Vincent/Grenadines (in</p>
<p>Mexico City).</p>
<p>Note: Top two teams advance to the final CONCACAF qualifying</p>
<p>round.</p>
</text>
